Mean = (2 + 4 + 6 + 8 + 10)/5 = 30/5 = 6.

Square deviations from the mean:

(2-6)**2 = 16;
(4-6)**2 = 4;
(6-6)**2 = 0;
(8-6)**2 = 4;
